        [
          "text3",
          "FLM_WARNING",
          "FLM02 only. On the tested G21, channels 1, 5, 7, 8 responded visibly on both sides at 100% PWM / 3 s; other tested channels had no visible reaction. Right channel 13 was once reported with unusual noise: avoid further testing until clarified. No automatic sequences. Set PWM and duration in Settings. P and stationary on private property, no persons in the beam."
        ],
